<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Alex Brown starts 3 electronics cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Alex Brown starts 3 electronics cos.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it started coverage of three electronics components companies.</p>
<p>-- Started AVX Corp with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Started Kemet Corp and Vishay Intertechnology Inc with buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- AVX shares closed on Wednesday at 23-1/8, Vishay closed at 25 and Kemet closed at 23-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
